  "description": "Even if she possesses it, Lily ends up possessing 'Maid 1' in a romantic novel.  I'm not the main character, but I knew the future, and I was a little hesitant - \"All I have to do is amnesia!\"  Thanks to this, she didn't know who the heroine was, who the male lead was, or even what role she possessed.  Still, to make a living, she works as a maid in the duke's family, but why is the people around her suspicious?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61737471), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%98%A4%EC%9E%91%EA%B5%90%EC%9D%98-%ED%95%98%EB%85%80%EC%9D%BC%EC%A7%80/3472)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/159619)",
